  ("Where can Texans get free, independent Medicare help?", "From HICAP &mdash; the Health Information, Counseling, and Advocacy Program &mdash; Texas&rsquo;s State Health Insurance Assistance Program, run as a partnership of Texas Health and Human Services, Texas Legal Services Center and the Area Agencies on Aging. The Texas Medicare Help Line is 1-800-252-9240. It is federally funded and free, and the counselors do not sell insurance."),
